OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders  
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA mostly dry 
OL,6,Fnight with some clear spells           
OL,7,Fdeveloping, leading to a cold and      
OL,8,Ffrosty night for many. Cloudier with a 
OL,9,Ffew showers near the east coast, less  
OL,10,Fcold here.                             
OL,12,CThursday:FA mostly dry day with some   
OL,13,Fbright intervals and the odd shower    
OL,14,Fpossible near the east coast. Rain     
OL,15,Fspreading into the west in the         
OL,16,Fevening. Winds strengthening,          
OL,17,Fespecially in west.                    
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
