OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders  
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FCloudy   
OL,6,Fwith strong winds and rain spreading   
OL,7,Feastwards Friday. Mostly dry and       
OL,8,Fcloudy on Saturday, then rain          
OL,9,Fovernight. Mostly dry with bright      
OL,10,Fspells on Sunday, showers in the west. 
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
